                                    <div>
                                        <h3 style="font-family: 'Outfit'; font-size: 1.05rem; color: #0f172a; margin: 0;">Two-Factor & Session Security</h3>
                                        <p style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 0.78rem; color: #64748b;">Protect your portal from unauthorized access</p>
